{% schema %}
{
  "name": "EyeWipes offer page",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "eyewipes-offer-page-section",
  "blocks": [{ "type": "@app" }],
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Add the Kaching Bundles app block to this section. Kaching stays the source of truth for tier, quantity, selling plan and free gifts — this section only restyles it."
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Top bar" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "topbar_line1", "label": "Line 1", "default": "Buy 2, Get 2 Free + Free Gifts" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "topbar_line2", "label": "Line 2", "default": "100-Day Risk-Free Home Trial" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Hero" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "End The Crusty Eyes In 30 Seconds A Day" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "subheading", "label": "Subheading", "default": "Textured antibacterial wipes for dogs with gunk, discharge & crusty eyes" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "picker_heading", "label": "Plan picker heading", "default": "Choose Your Plan" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "stock_line", "label": "Stock line", "default": "Selling fast — limited stock at this price" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "rc_note", "label": "RoutineCare note", "default": "Free shipping on every order" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Kaching deal IDs" },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Resolved from the live storefront. If a deal is rebuilt in Kaching, update the ID here — the page falls back to on-page order if an ID no longer matches."
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "deal_start", "label": "Start deal ID", "default": "4b8bf6d0-e6b1-4c44-af66-16e0ce39a9bb" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "deal_build", "label": "Build deal ID", "default": "508699d0-94c0-4818-af7b-59b2f44de961" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "deal_multi", "label": "Multi-Pet deal ID", "default": "43fd589f-426a-4e6c-b650-a63de934f2d0" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "FAQ" },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "faq_questions",
      "label": "Questions (one per line, max 8)",
      "default": "How soon will I see a difference?\nAre EyeWipes safe for sensitive eyes, puppies and cats?\nWill they help with old tear stains—and can the buildup return?\nHow often should I use EyeWipes, and do I need to rinse afterward?\nWhat if my dog dislikes having the eye area touched?\nHow long does one jar last, and which plan should I choose?\nWhat makes EyeWipes different from baby wipes and smooth wipes?\nHow do RoutineCare and the 100-day money-back guarantee work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "faq_answers",
      "label": "Answers (one per line, same order)",
      "default": "You may see the buildup EyeWipes removes on the pad from the very first use. How quickly the eye area looks cleaner depends on how much buildup is present, how long it has been there and how consistently you follow the routine. Older discoloration in the fur may take longer to fade or grow out.\nEyeWipes are designed for gentle external use around the eye area of dogs and cats, including puppies, when used as directed. Use a fresh pad for each eye and never wipe directly across the eyeball. If your pet has persistent redness, swelling, pain, an injury or unusual discharge, contact your veterinarian.\nEyeWipes help remove the daily residue and buildup collecting around the eyes, but they do not bleach already-discolored fur. Older staining may take time to fade or grow out. Because moisture and eye discharge can be ongoing, buildup may gradually return if the daily routine is stopped.\nUse EyeWipes once daily as part of your pet's regular care routine. With a fresh pad for each eye, gently wipe outward from the inner corner across the surrounding fur and skin, then discard the pad. No rinsing, mixing or preparation is needed.\nStart slowly and let your dog sniff the pad first. Choose a calm moment, keep the first sessions short and reward relaxed behavior afterward. Never force the routine. Most pets become more comfortable when the process stays gentle, predictable and quick.\nEach jar contains 100 pads. With one fresh pad per eye each day, one jar typically lasts approximately six to seven weeks for one pet. Start The Routine Kit is the smallest option, Build The Habit Kit provides a longer routine, and the Multi-Pet Relief Plan is best suited to longer use or homes with more than one pet. Actual duration depends on the number of pets and pads used.\nEyeWipes are made specifically for daily external care around the eyes. Their raised textured surface creates more contact with residue caught around the fur, while an ordinary smooth wipe can glide across the surface. EyeWipes are also pre-moistened, pH-balanced, fragrance-free and alcohol-free.\nRoutineCare saves 20% and includes free shipping on every recurring order. Deliveries can be skipped, changed or cancelled when needed. Your purchase is also protected by our 100-day money-back guarantee—if EyeWipes are not right for your pet, contact VetPets within 100 days of purchase for help with your refund."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "EyeWipes offer page" }]
}
{% endschema %}
